    description: "Ruby uses NameResolver (exact match, last-write-wins) not ListNameResolver. Wiring ambiguity_threshold requires either switching to ListNameResolver for method resolution or adding an explicit candidate-count check before resolution. More involved than PHP/JS/TS."  # ad2c
